{
  "checkpoint_id": "CP-0009",
  "claim": "The CP-0009 self-amdgpu-runtime child exposes the source-pinned GemSim provider metadata/transport boundary and passes the current static/shared package matrices plus a Clang AddressSanitizer+UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer matrix. The provider audit finds no host GPU library/device-node dependency, the shared ABI exports exactly the 16 sagr_provider_* metadata/transport functions, and unsupported provider calls remain deterministic. This is not a typed ROCr/libhsakmt implementation.",
